{"seq":1,"slug":"vehicle-can-network","title":"车载网络与通信","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles/vehicle-electronics-control/vehicle-can-network","wordCount":1599,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"车载网络与通信\">车载网络与通信</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>车载网络是新能源汽车各电子控制单元（ECU）之间交换数据的通信基础设施。从动力电池的BMS报文到ADAS摄像头的视频流，不同类型的数据对带宽、延迟和可靠性有截然不同的要求，因此现代汽车采用多种网络协议混合组网的分层架构。</p>\n<h3 id=\"can总线基础\">CAN总线基础</h3><p>CAN（Controller Area Network）是汽车电子通信的基石协议，由Bosch在1986年提出，至今仍承载 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span> 的车内通信需求。</p>\n<p><strong>物理层</strong>：差分信号传输（CAN_H - CAN_L），总线空闲时为隐性电平（差值约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> V），显性电平差值约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> V。波特率标准 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span> kbps（高速CAN），最大总线长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span> m（500kbps时）。线缆采用双绞线，两端各接 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">120</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span></span></span></span></span> Ω终端电阻匹配。</p>\n<p><strong>数据帧结构</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>位数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SOF</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>帧起始（显性）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仲裁段</td>\n<td>11/29</td>\n<td>标准/扩展ID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制段</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>DLC数据长度码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据段</td>\n<td>0-64</td>\n<td>有效载荷（最大8字节）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CRC段</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>校验码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ACK段</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>应答</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EOF</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>帧结束（隐性）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>非破坏性仲裁</strong>：多节点同时发送时，ID值越小（显性位越多）优先级越高。仲裁失败的节点自动退让，不影响高优先级报文的传输完整性。</p>\n<p>BMS典型CAN报文举例：报文ID <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>1806</mn><mi>E</mi><mn>5</mn><mi>F</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0x1806E5F4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">1806</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>（扩展帧），周期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> ms，包含总电压（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span> V/bit）、总电流（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span> A/bit，偏移 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-3200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">3200</span></span></span></span></span> A）、SOC（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.4\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4%</span></span></span></span></span>/bit）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"can-fd\">CAN-FD</h3><p>CAN-FD（Flexible Data-rate）向后兼容经典CAN，在仲裁段之后切换到更高波特率（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2-8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> Mbps），数据段扩展至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span></span> 字节：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>带宽提升</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mtext> Mbps</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>64</mn><mtext> bytes</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>500</mn><mtext> kbps</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mtext> bytes</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>128</mn><mtext>倍</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{带宽提升} = \\frac{8 \\text{ Mbps} \\times 64 \\text{ bytes}}{500 \\text{ kbps} \\times 8 \\text{ bytes}} \\approx 128 \\text{倍}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">带宽提升</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> kbps</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> bytes</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> Mbps</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> bytes</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">128</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">倍</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>CAN-FD保留了经典CAN的非破坏性仲裁机制，仲裁段仍以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span> kbps速率传输。适用于固件刷写（大数据块传输）和高精度传感器数据上报。</p>\n<h3 id=\"lin总线\">LIN总线</h3><p>LIN（Local Interconnect Network）是低成本辅助网络，主从式通信，波特率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> kbps。典型应用于雨刷、车窗、座椅调节等低速执行器控制。单线传输，成本仅为CAN的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/3</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>每个LIN子网由一个主节点（通常是门控制器）和多个从节点组成，主节点发送调度表中的帧头（含ID），指定的从节点填充数据域响应。</p>\n<h3 id=\"车载以太网\">车载以太网</h3><p>传统CAN的带宽瓶颈无法满足ADAS摄像头（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> Mbps）、激光雷达点云（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;300</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span></span></span></span></span> Mbps）和OTA大文件传输的需求。车载以太网成为下一代骨干网络：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标准</th>\n<th>速率</th>\n<th>线缆</th>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>100BASE-T1</td>\n<td>100 Mbps</td>\n<td>单对非屏蔽双绞线</td>\n<td>域控互联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1000BASE-T1</td>\n<td>1 Gbps</td>\n<td>单对屏蔽双绞线</td>\n<td>摄像头/雷达数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10GBASE-T1</td>\n<td>10 Gbps</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>中央计算平台（规划中）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>车载以太网与办公以太网的关键差异：单对线缆（非4对）、全双工PAM3/PAM5编码、满足EMC车规标准（OPEN Alliance TC8）、支持TSN时间敏感网络实现确定性延迟。</p>\n<h3 id=\"obd-ii诊断接口\">OBD-II诊断接口</h3><p>OBD-II（On-Board Diagnostics）是法规强制的标准化诊断接口。DLC（Diagnostic Link Connector）采用16针J1962标准，通常位于驾驶员侧仪表板下方：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pin 6/14：CAN_H / CAN_L（ISO 15765-4）</li>\n<li>Pin 4：车身地</li>\n<li>Pin 16：电源（常电 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> V）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>通过OBD-II可访问标准化PID（Parameter ID）读取发动机/电池/排放数据，以及制造商自定义扩展诊断。</p>\n<h3 id=\"uds统一诊断服务\">UDS统一诊断服务</h3><p>UDS（Unified Diagnostic Services，ISO 14229）定义了诊断仪与ECU之间的应用层通信协议，在CAN传输层（ISO 15765-2，即ISO-TP）之上运行。</p>\n<p>核心服务（SID）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SID</th>\n<th>服务名称</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0x10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>DiagnosticSessionControl</td>\n<td>切换诊断会话（默认/扩展/编程）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>27</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0x27</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">27</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>SecurityAccess</td>\n<td>安全访问（种子-密钥机制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>22</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0x22</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">22</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>ReadDataByIdentifier</td>\n<td>读取DID数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0x2E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>WriteDataByIdentifier</td>\n<td>写入DID数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>19</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0x19</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">19</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>ReadDTCInformation</td>\n<td>读取故障码信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0x14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>ClearDiagnosticInformation</td>\n<td>清除故障码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>31</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0x31</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">31</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>RoutineControl</td>\n<td>启动/停止例程（如执行自检）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>34</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>36</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0x34-36</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">34</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>RequestDownload/Transfer/Exit</td>\n<td>固件刷写</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>诊断请求-响应模型：诊断仪发送请求（SID + 子功能/参数），ECU返回正响应（SID + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0x40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span>）或负响应（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0x7F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> + SID + NRC错误码）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"域控制器与网关架构\">域控制器与网关架构</h3><p>传统分布式架构（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span>个独立ECU）正向域集中架构演进：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;中央网关&quot;] &lt;--&gt;|以太网| B[&quot;动力域控制器&quot;]&#10;    A &lt;--&gt;|以太网| C[&quot;底盘域控制器&quot;]&#10;    A &lt;--&gt;|以太网| D[&quot;智驾域控制器&quot;]&#10;    A &lt;--&gt;|以太网| E[&quot;座舱域控制器&quot;]&#10;    A &lt;--&gt;|以太网| F[&quot;车身域控制器&quot;]&#10;    B &lt;--&gt;|CAN-FD| G[&quot;BMS/MCU/VCU&quot;]&#10;    D &lt;--&gt;|以太网| H[&quot;摄像头/雷达&quot;]&#10;    F &lt;--&gt;|LIN| I[&quot;车灯/车窗/座椅&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"中央网关\"] &lt;--&gt;|以太网| B[\"动力域控制器\"]\n    A &lt;--&gt;|以太网| C[\"底盘域控制器\"]\n    A &lt;--&gt;|以太网| D[\"智驾域控制器\"]\n    A &lt;--&gt;|以太网| E[\"座舱域控制器\"]\n    A &lt;--&gt;|以太网| F[\"车身域控制器\"]\n    B &lt;--&gt;|CAN-FD| G[\"BMS/MCU/VCU\"]\n    D &lt;--&gt;|以太网| H[\"摄像头/雷达\"]\n    F &lt;--&gt;|LIN| I[\"车灯/车窗/座椅\"]</pre><p>中央网关负责跨域报文路由、协议转换（CAN↔以太网）、防火墙过滤和诊断转发。区域控制器（Zonal Architecture）按物理位置布置，进一步缩短线束长度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>以太网TSN</strong>（Time-Sensitive Networking）：通过IEEE 802.1Qbv时间感知调度，在以太网上实现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> ms确定性延迟，替代FlexRay用于底盘域</li>\n<li><strong>CAN XL</strong>：下一代CAN标准，数据段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2048</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2048</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2048</span></span></span></span></span> 字节，速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> Mbps，桥接CAN-FD与以太网的过渡方案</li>\n<li><strong>车载5G-V2X</strong>：Uu接口与PC5接口融合，实现车-云-路-人全连接</li>\n<li><strong>软件定义汽车（SDV）</strong>：SOA服务化架构取代信号级通信，应用间通过SOME/IP进行服务发现和RPC调用</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>某CAN网络有A（ID <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0x100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span>）、B（ID <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0x200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span>）、C（ID <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>080</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0x080</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">080</span></span></span></span></span>）三个节点同时发送，哪个获得仲裁？解释仲裁过程中各节点的行为。</li>\n<li>使用CAN分析仪（如PCAN-View）捕获BMS报文，某帧数据域为 <code>09 C4 00 00 13 88 32 00</code>。如果总电压的起始位为Byte0-1（大端），分辨率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span> V，请解析总电压值。</li>\n<li>设计一个包含CAN-FD和以太网的混合网络拓扑：BMS通过CAN-FD上报数据至动力域控制器，域控制器通过以太网与中央网关通信。画出拓扑图并标注各段的速率。</li>\n<li>UDS服务 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mn>22</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0x22</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">22</span></span></span></span></span> 读取DID <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>F</mi><mn>190</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0xF190</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\">190</span></span></span></span></span>（VIN码），写出完整的请求报文和正响应报文格式。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>车载网络构成新能源汽车的数字化基础设施。CAN/CAN-FD承载控制域的实时通信，LIN服务于低速执行器，车载以太网提供大带宽骨干传输。OBD-II和UDS协议是故障诊断的标准化工具链。从分布式ECU到域集中再到中央计算的架构演进，本质是用更高带宽和更少线束实现更强的软件定义能力。掌握这些网络协议和诊断方法，是新能源汽车维修技师进行系统级故障排查的必备技能。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"车载网络与通信","id":"车载网络与通信"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"CAN总线基础","id":"can总线基础"},{"level":3,"text":"CAN-FD","id":"can-fd"},{"level":3,"text":"LIN总线","id":"lin总线"},{"level":3,"text":"车载以太网","id":"车载以太网"},{"level":3,"text":"OBD-II诊断接口","id":"obd-ii诊断接口"},{"level":3,"text":"UDS统一诊断服务","id":"uds统一诊断服务"},{"level":3,"text":"域控制器与网关架构","id":"域控制器与网关架构"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"传动系统与集成","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles/electric-drive-systems/transmission-integration"},"next":{"title":"充电技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles/vehicle-electronics-control/charging-technology"}}